        {
          "text": "0"
        },
        {
          "text": "Make the beef tenderloin marinade by combining soy sauce, vinegar, ginger, garlic, sesame oil, olive oil, sugar, salt, and ground black pepper in a large bowl"
        },
        {
          "text": "Mix well"
        },
        {
          "text": "1"
