        },
        {
          "text": "Let it stay for 1 hour"
        },
        {
          "text": "2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Using a metal or bamboo skewer, assemble the beef kebob by skewering the vegetables and marinated beef tenderloin"
        },
        {
          "text": "3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Heat-up the grill and start grilling the beef kebobs for 3 minutes per side"
        },
        {
          "text": "This will give you a medium beef that is juicy and tender on the inside"
        },
        {
          "text": "Add more time if you want your beef well done, but it will be less tender"
        },
        {
          "text": "4"
        },
        {
          "text": "Transfer to a serving plate"
        },
        {
          "text": "Serve with Saffron rice"
        },
        {
          "text": "5"
        },
        {
          "text": "Share and enjoy!"
