          "text": "In a glass dish or bowl, combine half of the sake mixture with the chicken pieces and toss to coat"
        },
        {
          "text": "Cover dish and place in refrigerator for about 30 minutes"
        },
        {
          "text": "In a medium frying pan, combine remaining sake mixture, chillies, vinegar and sugar"
        },
        {
          "text": "Mix together and add spring onion, garlic, water chestnuts and peanuts"
        },
        {
          "text": "Heat sauce slowly over medium heat until aromatic"
        },
        {
          "text": "Meanwhile, remove chicken from marinade and sauté in a large frying pan until juices run clear"
        },
        {
          "text": "When sauce is aromatic, add sautéed chicken and let simmer together until sauce thickens."
