          "category": "condimentos"
        }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "text": "STEP 1 - MARINATING THE BEEF"
        },
        {
          "text": "In a bowl, add the beef, salt, 1 pinch white pepper, 1 Teaspoon sesame seed oil, 1/2 egg, corn starch,1 Tablespoon of oil and mix together"
        },
        {
          "text": "STEP 2 - BOILING THE THE NOODLES"
        },
        {
          "text": "In a 6 qt pot add your noodles to boiling water until the noodles are submerged and boil on high heat for 10 seconds"
        },
        {
          "text": "After your noodles is done boiling strain and cool with cold water"
        },
        {
          "text": "STEP 3 - STIR FRY"
        },
        {
          "text": "Add 2 Tablespoons of oil, beef and cook on high heat untill beef is medium cooked"
        },
        {
          "text": "Set the cooked beef aside"
        },
        {
          "text": "In a wok add 2 Tablespoon of oil, onions, minced garlic, minced ginger, bean sprouts, mushrooms, peapods and 1.5 cups of water or until the vegetables are submerged in water"
        },
        {
          "text": "Add the noodles to wok"
        },
        {
          "text": "To make the sauce, add oyster sauce, 1 pinch white pepper, 1 teaspoon sesame seed oil, sugar, and 1 Teaspoon of soy sauce"
        },
        {
          "text": "Next add the beef to wok and stir-fry"
        }
