      "id": "tmdb-53482",
      "title": "Black bean & meat stew - feijoada",
      "description": "Receta de cocina internacional (categoría: Beef). Importada de TheMealDB.",
      "emoji": "🍽️",
      "image": "https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xrxz7h1782592711.jpg",
