        {
          "name": "Soy sauce",
          "quantity": 1,
          "unit": "tbs",
          "category": "condimentos"
        }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "text": "STEP 1 - MARINATING THE BEEF"
        },
        {
          "text": "In a bowl, add the beef, salt, sesame seed oil, white pepper, egg white, 2 Tablespoon of corn starch and 1 Tablespoon of oil"
        },
        {
          "text": "STEP 2 - STIR FRY"
        },
        {
          "text": "First Cook the beef by adding 2 Tablespoon of oil until the beef is golden brown"
        },
        {
          "text": "Set the beef aside"
        },
        {
          "text": "In a wok add 1 Tablespoon of oil, minced ginger, minced garlic and stir-fry for few seconds"
        },
        {
          "text": "Next add all of the vegetables and then add sherry cooking wine and 1 cup of water"
        },
        {
          "text": "To make the sauce add oyster sauce, hot pepper sauce, and sugar"
        },
        {
          "text": "add the cooked beef and 1 spoon of soy sauce"
        },
        {
          "text": "To thicken the sauce, whisk together 1 Tablespoon of cornstarch and 2 Tablespoon of water in a bowl and slowly add to your stir-fry until it's the right thickness."
        }
      ],
