      "id": "tmdb-53412",
      "title": "Lakra me Mish Cabbage and Meat Stew",
      "description": "Receta de cocina internacional (categoría: Beef). Importada de TheMealDB.",
      "emoji": "🍽️",
      "image": "https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/mobh1l1779648766.jpg",
