    {
      "id": "tmdb-53374",
      "title": "Sichuan Eggplant",
      "description": "Receta de Chinese (categoría: Vegetarian). Importada de TheMealDB.",
      "emoji": "🍽️",
      "image": "https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1oz4nb1765687990.jpg",
      "source": "themealdb",
      "diets": [
        "sin-lactosa"
      ],
      "cuisine": "chinese",
      "suitableFor": [
        "desayuno",
        "almuerzo"
      ],
      "prepMinutes": 15,
      "cookMinutes": 30,
      "servings": 4,
      "ingredients": [
        {
          "name": "Egg plants",
          "quantity": 1.5,
          "unit": "pounds sliced",
          "category": "proteinas"
        },
        {
          "name": "Peanut oil",
          "quantity": 2,
          "unit": "tablespoons",
          "category": "despensa"
        },
        {
          "name": "Chicken stock",
          "quantity": 0.25,
          "unit": "cup",
          "category": "proteinas"
        },
        {
          "name": "Sugar",
          "quantity": 2,
          "unit": "tsp",
          "category": "despensa"
        },
        {
          "name": "Soy sauce",
          "quantity": 0.5,
          "unit": "tsp",
          "category": "condimentos"
        },
        {
          "name": "Chilli bean paste",
          "quantity": 1.5,
          "unit": "tbsp",
          "category": "granos"
        },
        {
          "name": "Sichuan pepper",
          "quantity": 2,
          "unit": "tsp",
          "category": "verduras"
        },
        {
          "name": "Ginger",
          "quantity": 2,
          "unit": "tsp",
          "category": "otros"
        },
        {
          "name": "Garlic",
          "quantity": 5,
          "unit": "cloves",
          "category": "verduras"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cornstarch",
          "quantity": 1,
          "unit": "tsp",
          "category": "granos"
        },
        {
          "name": "Apple cider vinegar",
          "quantity": 2,
          "unit": "tsp",
          "category": "frutas"
        },
        {
          "name": "Scallions",
          "quantity": 4,
          "unit": "Chopped",
          "category": "otros"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cilantro",
          "quantity": 1,
          "unit": "Garnish",
          "category": "otros"
        }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "text": "This recipe calls for asian eggplants, or Japanese eggplants"
        },
        {
          "text": "They are long and thin compared to a European or globe eggplant, and much more tender and delicate"
        },
        {
          "text": "If you can't find them you can substitute globe eggplant, but the dish is really best with the asian eggplant"
        },
        {
          "text": "*A lot of grocery stores have Asian ingredient aisles now"
        },
        {
          "text": "You should be able to find chili-bean paste, a mixture of preserved chilies mixed with mashed soybeans, there or at any Asian market"
        },
        {
          "text": "(Do not confuse with black bean paste or chili-garlic paste.)"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Sichuan peppercorns are available at some stores and online for quite cheap"
        },
        {
          "text": "They aren't spicy like other peppers but rather have a citrusy flavor and induce a tingly, numbing sensation like a carbonated drink"
        },
        {
          "text": "Prep eggplant, chili sauce, cornstarch slurry, vinegar and scallions:"
        },
        {
          "text": "Begin your mise en place"
        },
        {
          "text": "Quarter the eggplant lengthwise and chop into large batons and set aside"
        },
        {
          "text": "In a small bowl, mix together the chicken stock, sugar, and soy sauce and set it aside"
        },
        {
          "text": "In a second bowl, mix together the chili bean paste, garlic, ginger, and sichuan peppercorns and set it aside"
        },
        {
          "text": "In a third bowl, mix together the cornstarch with a tablespoon of water and set it aside"
        },
        {
          "text": "Lastly, in a fourth bowl, mix together the scallions and vinegar and set it aside"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauté eggplant:"
        },
        {
          "text": "Place the oil in a wok or large sauté pan over medium-high heat until the oil is almost smoking"
        },
        {
          "text": "Add the eggplant and sauté, allowing it to sit for a few seconds each time you move it to allow it to brown and blister"
        },
        {
          "text": "If the eggplant absorbs all the oil and some pieces don't get any then add a little more oil"
        },
        {
          "text": "Add the chili bean paste, garlic, ginger, and sichuan peppercorns and sauté:"
        },
        {
          "text": "until fragrant, about 30 seconds"
        },
        {
          "text": "Add the chicken stock mixture:"
        },
        {
          "text": "turn the heat to medium-low and simmer for 90 seconds"
        },
        {
          "text": "Add the cornstarch mixture:"
        },
        {
          "text": "and stir together until the sauce thickens a bit"
        },
        {
          "text": "Add the scallions and vinegar:"
        },
        {
          "text": "and cook for 15 seconds to diffuse their harsh flavors a bit"
        },
        {
          "text": "Garnish with cilantro and serve."
        }
      ],
      "tips": [],
      "nutrition": {
        "kcal": 0,
        "protein": 0,
        "carbs": 0,
        "fat": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tmdb-53456",
