      "id": "tmdb-53157",
      "title": "Chorizo & soft-boiled egg salad",
      "description": "Receta de Spanish (categoría: Pork). Importada de TheMealDB.",
      "emoji": "🍽️",
      "image": "https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/v8eaed1763257313.jpg",
