          "text": "Steps for Ugali:"
        },
        {
          "text": "Bring the water and salt to a boil in a heavy-bottomed saucepan"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stir in the cornmeal slowly, letting it fall through the fingers of your hand"
        },
        {
          "text": "3"
