      "title": "Crispy Eggplant",
      "description": "Receta de Filipino (categoría: Vegetarian). Importada de TheMealDB.",
      "emoji": "🍽️",
      "image": "https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/c7lzrl1683208757.jpg",
